# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages (and Netlify). This is the portable twin of
# the RewriteRule in dist/.htaccess: any path that is not a real file is served
# index.html so the React router can resolve it.
#
# Static assets are matched BEFORE these rules, so this never shadows a real
# file — including /.well-known/*, which Apache needs an explicit exemption for
# but Pages handles on its own.
/*    /index.html   200
